  "details": "May you guys Please fix android vrc for android 10 please. As the camera system doesnt even work because the scripts required and minimum android version is android 11 to even use the camera. I would suggest adding the minimum version of android 10 and changing the required version to instead a targeted version of android 14 in the file that controls the camera scripts. Also I wanna suggest that you guys fix mouse and keyboard for mobile android or at least add hand gesture controls for mobile touch ui similar to the jump, crouch, stand for but with left and right hand gestures seperated. Now back to the camera issue, Android 10 is able to access the data directory unlike 11 onward. Also 11 and onward uses Android/media directories and vrchat mobile can put the screenshots and photos there without you devs even having to add a permission for specifically android 10 users. All that would need done for the camera to work is to change the scripts layout to have a minimum version of android 10 and a target version of android 14 instead of the minimum version of android 11 and required version of android 11.",
